cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software in your research, please cite the paper below.
title: toktier
abstract: >-
  Correctness-first tokenization with a certified fast path: a Python library
  that produces token IDs equal to a frozen Hugging Face tokenizers reference,
  routes requests to GPU or CPU backends only where certification evidence
  covers the exact tokenizer artifact, and keeps append-style session state in a
  persistent store that is verified on hit.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/asu-idi/toktier"

authors:
